  "description": "Things to do NOW before the next Bear Market",
  "body_html": "<p><em>👋 Welcome to <strong>StockTok</strong></em>! A few things you should be doing in preparation for the bear market. Quick question: Do you think I should consolidate the <em><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/timothys-stocktok-tracker?r=4z8lgl\">Current Stock Positions</a>  </strong></em>and the<em><strong> <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-daily-update?r=4z8lgl\">Daily Stock Screener</a> </strong></em>into a single document? I was thinking about doing that, and including all the references in there as well. Just a centralized location. Let me know your thoughts in the comments. Little bit of a choppy day, but I don’t see anything alarming….right now!</p><p>Also…I am glad we are in a bull market. Been a nice couple of weeks. But as a creator who normally sees hundreds of comments a day, I must say, this has been the quietest and saddest bull market I’ve seen. Are you thinking the same?</p><div class=\"native-video-embed\" data-component-name=\"VideoPlaceholder\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;mediaUploadId&quot;:&quot;201f3029-51a3-424f-b055-c091c5431074&quot;,&quot;duration&quot;:null}\"></div><div><hr></div><p><em>For more: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em> <em><strong>| <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing for Beginners</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/timothys-stocktok-tracker?r=4z8lgl\">Current Stock Positions</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-daily-update?r=4z8lgl\">Daily Stock Screener</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a> </strong></em></p><div class=\"subscription-widget-wrap-editor\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"SubscribeWidgetToDOM\"><div class=\"subscription-widget show-subscribe\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">If you like StockTok’s content, consider subscribing for more updates!</p></div><form class=\"subscription-widget-subscribe\"><input type=\"email\" class=\"email-input\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Type your email…\" tabindex=\"-1\"><input type=\"submit\" class=\"button primary\" value=\"Subscribe\"><div class=\"fake-input-wrapper\"><div class=\"fake-input\"></div><div class=\"fake-button\"></div></div></form></div></div><p></p><p></p>",
